---
import { profile } from '../data/profile';
import Rail from './Rail.astro';
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<section id="about" class="section wrap report" aria-labelledby="about-title">
  <Rail label="About / contact" addr="00401080" />
  <div class="report-main">
    <h2 id="about-title">Curious about what software actually does.</h2>
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-copy">
        <p>I’m a final-year cybersecurity engineering student at UEMF, increasingly focused on how software behaves internally: <strong>binary behavior, reverse engineering, malware analysis, and vulnerability research</strong>.</p>
        <p>That sits on a practical base of network security, offensive security, detection, Linux systems, and CTFs, where I compete as Awdyane. I’d rather read the artifact than trust the description of it.</p>
        <dl class="meta about-meta">
          <dt>EDUCATION</dt><dd>Engineering in Cybersecurity, EIDIA · UEMF, Fès</dd>
          <dt>GRADUATION</dt><dd>Expected 2027</dd>
        </dl>
      </div>
      <div class="contact" id="contact">
        <h3 id="contact-title">Let’s talk security.</h3>
        <p class="contact-intro">Open to security projects, technical conversations, and opportunities to learn.</p>
        <a class="big-mail" href={`mailto:${profile.email}`}><span class="label k">Email</span>{profile.email}</a>
        <div class="contact-list">
          <a href={profile.linkedin}><span><span class="label k">LinkedIn</span><span class="v">yassine-elghazi</span></span><Icon name="external" /></a>
          <a href={profile.github}><span><span class="label k">GitHub</span><span class="v">Yassine-El-Ghazi</span></span><Icon name="external" /></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
